pmp:NewThoughtShinnLetMeNowExpressTheDivineIdea a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Affirmation asking to express the Divine Idea now"@en, "Affirmation: lass mich jetzt die göttliche Idee ausdrücken"@de ;
    skos:definition "Repeat, as a new order to the subconscious, a statement asking to express the Divine Idea in mind, body and affairs."@en ;
    skos:note "Affirmation; to be repeated."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnPowerOfTheSpokenWord ;
    dcterms:source "Florence Scovel Shinn, The Power of the Spoken Word (1945), in The Writings of Florence Scovel Shinn, eBook ed. (www.Self-Improvement-eBooks.com, 2007), Book Four, ch. 1 \"Weapons Ye Know Not Of\", p. 243; read in the archive.org text layers TheCompleteWorksOfFlorenceScovelShinn and the-writing-of-florence-scovel-shinn of this eBook; agreement with the 1945 print unchecked" .

pmc:NewThoughtShinnLetMeNowExpressTheDivineIdeaYieldsExpandingRapidlyIntoTheDivinePlan a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Divine Idea affirmation yields expansion into the Divine Plan"@en, "Affirmation der göttlichen Idee bewirkt Eintritt in den göttlichen Plan"@de ;
    skos:definition "Repeating the statement is said to bring amazing changes soon."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:NewThoughtShinnLetMeNowExpressTheDivineIdea ;
