pmc:NewThoughtShinnBombardedByNewIdeas a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Being flooded with new ideas and a bodily chemical change"@en, "Überflutung mit neuen Ideen und chemische Veränderung im Körper"@de ;
    skos:definition "Announced in advance as following the Divine Idea affirmation: amazement at quick changes, a bombardment of new ideas and ideals, a chemical shift in the body."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a sign of success: the text names it as a mark that the work has taken effect. Counted apart from conditions of failure. It is announced for pmp:NewThoughtShinnLetMeNowExpressTheDivineIdea."@en ;
