pmc:NewThoughtShinnNegativeThoughtsHaveAlwaysDefeated a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Negative thought-forms defeat the heart's desire"@en, "Negative Gedankenformen vereiteln den Herzenswunsch"@de ;
    skos:definition "Entrenched negative thoughts are named as the cause that has always prevented the manifestation of the desire."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a failure condition: the text names an outcome that goes wrong or does not come, and its cause."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnPowerOfTheSpokenWord ;
