    rdfs:label "Realization of full equipment yields open doors"@en, "Verwirklichung der Ausrüstung bewirkt offene Türen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Conditional claim: if the realization were gained, these effects would follow."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:NewThoughtShinnMoreThanEqualToEverySituation ;
