pmc:NewThoughtShinnConcentrationMeansLovingAbsorption a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Concentration as loving absorption; success only in what interests us"@en, "Konzentration als liebende Versenkung; Erfolg nur in dem, was uns fesselt"@de ;
    skos:definition "Concentration is defined as loving absorption, as in children at play; success is possible only in a field that deeply interests the person."@en ;
    skos:note "Reached via Dr. Ernest Wilson's report of reading Emerson on concentration."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnPowerOfTheSpokenWord ;
