    rdfs:label "Against impatience and discouragement"@en, "Gegen Ungeduld und Entmutigung"@de ;
    skos:definition "People easily grow impatient and discouraged; unlike the racehorse Omaha that needs a mile to find its stride, one can reach spiritual stride instantly."@en ;
    pm:cautionsAbout pmc:NewThoughtShinnSpiritualStride ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
