pmc:NewThoughtShinnSpiritualStride a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Instant spiritual stride"@en, "Augenblicklicher geistiger Schritt"@de ;
    skos:definition "One may enter one's spiritual stride and win the race in an instant."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a capacity: a state the text holds attainable."@en ;
