pmp:NewThoughtShinnDelightThyselfInTheLaw a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Delight in the law: enjoy making a demonstration"@en, "Freude am Gesetz: Demonstrieren genießen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Treat demonstrating as an enjoyable game: take pleasure in trusting God and be happy to act on intuitive leads, as one enjoys golf or tennis."@en ;
    skos:note "Interpreted Psalm 37:4."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
