pmc:NewThoughtShinnGotToDemonstrateMoneyAgain a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Grudging demonstration and fear of one's hunches"@en, "Widerwilliges Demonstrieren und Angst vor den eigenen Eingebungen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Sighing at having to demonstrate money again, or being too nervous to follow hunches, is cited as the attitude opposed to delight in the law."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a failure condition: the text names an outcome that goes wrong or does not come, and its cause. It names how pmp:NewThoughtShinnDelightThyselfInTheLaw fails."@en ;
