pmc:NewThoughtShinnPlayingWithUnseenForces a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Life as a game played with unseen forces"@en, "Das Leben als Spiel mit unsichtbaren Kräften"@de ;
    skos:definition "The difficulty of enjoying life is that its balls and goal are invisible; its goal is the Divine Plan, where conditions are permanently perfect."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnPowerOfTheSpokenWord ;
