    rdfs:label "Complicated lives from thinking things out"@en, "Verwickeltes Leben durch Ausdenken"@de ;
    skos:definition "Lives become complicated because people try to reason their way out rather than intuit it."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a failure condition: the text names an outcome that goes wrong or does not come, and its cause. It names how pmp:NewThoughtShinnLinkWithIntuitionEveryMoment fails."@en ;
