pmc:NewThoughtShinnSheReasonsAndWeighsAndMeasures a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Case: the Truth student who reasons never solves her problem"@en, "Fall: die Wahrheitsschülerin, die abwägt, löst ihr Problem nie"@de ;
    skos:definition "A woman claiming full knowledge of Truth weighs and measures every problem by reason; her problems are never solved."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a failure condition: the text names an outcome that goes wrong or does not come, and its cause. It names how pmp:NewThoughtShinnLinkWithIntuitionEveryMoment fails."@en ;
