pmc:NewThoughtShinnReasoningMindMustBeRedeemed a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Reason needs redemption"@en, "Der Verstand muss erlöst werden"@de ;
    skos:definition "Asked whether reason is ever any good, she answers that it has to be redeemed, and advises trust in spiritual law."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnPowerOfTheSpokenWord ;
    dcterms:source "Florence Scovel Shinn, The Power of the Spoken Word (1945), in The Writings of Florence Scovel Shinn, eBook ed. (www.Self-Improvement-eBooks.com, 2007), Book Four, ch. 1 \"Weapons Ye Know Not Of\", p. 245; read in the archive.org text layers TheCompleteWorksOfFlorenceScovelShinn and the-writing-of-florence-scovel-shinn of this eBook; agreement with the 1945 print unchecked" .

pmp:NewThoughtShinnBeAGoodReceiver a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Be a good receiver: prepare, rejoice, give thanks"@en, "Ein guter Empfänger sein: vorbereiten, sich freuen, danken"@de ;
    skos:definition "Do your part by preparing for the blessing, rejoicing and giving thanks beforehand."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnPowerOfTheSpokenWord ;
