pmc:NewThoughtShinnBeAGoodReceiverYieldsTheDemonstrationComesToPass a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Good receiving brings the blessing to pass"@en, "Gutes Empfangen lässt den Segen eintreten"@de ;
    skos:definition "The text holds that the practice \"Be a good receiver: prepare, rejoice, give thanks\" brings about \"The demonstration comes to pass\"."@en ;
