pmp:NewThoughtShinnWaysWhichWillAstoundYou a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Closing statement: God's unknown weapons and astounding ways"@en, "Schlusssatz: Gottes unbekannte Waffen und erstaunliche Wege"@de ;
    skos:definition "A statement in God's voice to be held: there are hidden weapons and ways that will astonish the hearer."@en ;
    skos:note "Affirmation closing ch. 1; no separate effect stated."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
