pmc:NewThoughtShinnWatchYourWordsWithAllDiligence a pm:Cautioning ;
    rdfs:label "Watch your words: the tongue holds life and death"@en, "Auf die Worte achten: Leben und Tod liegen in der Zunge"@de ;
    skos:definition "Since one always reaps the fruit of one's words, speech must be guarded diligently."@en ;
    pm:cautionsAbout pmp:NewThoughtShinnCallingOnTheLaw ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
