    rdfs:label "Immunity affirmation yields reunion and marriage (case)"@en, "Unverletzlichkeits-Affirmation bewirkt Versöhnung und Ehe (Fall)"@de ;
    skos:definition "Told as a case of a client, friend or acquaintance: the practice \"Affirmation of immunity to hurt and resentment\" was followed by the outcome \"right marriage and happy home\"."@en ;
