    rdfs:label "Case: right marriage and happy home"@en, "Fall: die rechte Ehe und ein glückliches Heim"@de ;
    skos:definition "After months, the client felt only kindness for the man; he returned, asked forgiveness, they married and a happy home manifested, built around her active faith."@en ;
