    rdfs:label "The only enemies are within; hurt and resentment as serpents and scorpions"@en, "Die einzigen Feinde sind innen; Kränkung und Groll als Schlangen und Skorpione"@de ;
    skos:definition "Scriptural enemies are read as inner states; hurt and resentment have wrecked many lives."@en ;
