pmc:NewThoughtShinnFearOfLoss a pm:Cautioning ;
    rdfs:label "Fear of loss, the most prevalent fear"@en, "Verlustangst, die verbreitetste Furcht"@de ;
    skos:definition "Even with everything life can give, apprehension creeps in whispering that it is too good to last; heeding it brings worry."@en ;
    pm:cautionsAbout pmc:NewThoughtShinnDepreciationAndFearOfLoss ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
