pmc:NewThoughtShinnWavingOverItTheWandOfHisWordYieldsAFriendlyAiredale a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "The word-wand transmutes the lion"@en, "Der Wort-Stab verwandelt den Löwen"@de ;
    skos:definition "The text holds that the practice \"Waving the wand of the word over a condition\" brings about \"The feared obstacle turns out harmless\"."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:NewThoughtShinnWavingOverItTheWandOfHisWord ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:NewThoughtShinnAFriendlyAiredale ;
