pmc:NewThoughtShinnAFriendlyAiredalePresupposesWalkingUpToTheLion a pm:Presupposing ;
    rdfs:label "The word works only if one walks up to the lion"@en, "Das Wort wirkt nur, wenn man auf den Löwen zugeht"@de ;
    skos:definition "Speaking the word is insufficient without facing the situation."@en ;
    pm:dependentStep pmc:NewThoughtShinnAFriendlyAiredale ;
