pmc:NewThoughtShinnImmediateAndEndlessSupplyPresupposesStandingStillMeansToKeepYourPoise a pm:Presupposing ;
    rdfs:label "Trust, poise and right of way for Infinite Intelligence"@en, "Vertrauen, Fassung und Vorfahrt für die Unendliche Intelligenz"@de ;
    skos:definition "The divine Intelligence is said to know the exit and the supply for each demand, yet it must be trusted, poise kept, and it must be allowed to lead."@en ;
    pm:dependentStep pmc:NewThoughtShinnImmediateAndEndlessSupply ;
    pm:priorStep pmp:NewThoughtShinnStandingStillMeansToKeepYourPoise ;
