pmc:NewThoughtShinnSituationRunsAfterThem a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Running from disagreeable situations makes them pursue you"@en, "Wer unangenehmen Lagen ausweicht, wird von ihnen verfolgt"@de ;
    skos:definition "Fear of people and flight from unpleasant situations ensures the situation follows."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a failure condition: the text names an outcome that goes wrong or does not come, and its cause. It names how pmp:NewThoughtShinnWalkingUpToTheLion fails."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnPowerOfTheSpokenWord ;
