    rdfs:label "Psalm 27 statement yields dissolution of the situation"@en, "Psalm-27-Satz löst die Lage auf"@de ;
    skos:definition "The text holds that the practice \"Face the situation fearlessly with Psalm 27\" brings about \"Negative situations dissolve in the light of Truth\"."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:NewThoughtShinnTheLordIsMyLightAndSalvation ;
