    rdfs:label "Words of authority yield the routing of negative thoughts"@en, "Worte der Vollmacht vertreiben die negativen Gedanken"@de ;
    skos:definition "The text holds that the practice \"Counter each negative thought with an authoritative word\" together with \"Affirmation: divine supply springing up like mushrooms\" together with \"Affirmation: God appreciates me, so man appreciates me; success cannot be blocked\" brings about \"Freedom from negative thoughts\"."@en ;
