pmc:NewThoughtShinnOffYourGuard a pm:Cautioning ;
    rdfs:label "The negative thoughts return when you are off guard"@en, "Die negativen Gedanken kehren zurück, wenn man unachtsam ist"@de ;
    skos:definition "After a victory the enemy thoughts start again with new themes; persistence and vigilance are needed."@en ;
