pmp:NewThoughtShinnGodAppreciatesMe a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Affirmation: God appreciates me, so man appreciates me; success cannot be blocked"@en, "Affirmation: Gott schätzt mich, darum schätzen mich die Menschen; der Erfolg ist unaufhaltbar"@de ;
    skos:definition "Reply to thoughts of being unappreciated or never succeeding by declaring God's and man's appreciation and that nothing can interfere with one's divinely designed success."@en ;
    skos:note "Affirmation, as counter-statement."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnPowerOfTheSpokenWord ;
