    rdfs:label "Starving the thoughts yields their dissolution"@en, "Aushungern bewirkt ihre Auflösung"@de ;
    skos:definition "The text holds that the practice \"Starve fear thoughts by withholding attention and acting faith\" brings about \"Freedom from negative thoughts\"."@en ;
