pmp:NewThoughtShinnStarveOutTheFearThoughts a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Starve fear thoughts by withholding attention and acting faith"@en, "Furchtgedanken aushungern durch Entzug der Aufmerksamkeit und Glaubenshandeln"@de ;
    skos:definition "Give fear thoughts no attention and act as if in faith; the lion's fierceness comes from one's own fear."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
