pmc:NewThoughtShinnSystemOfGifts a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "System of gifts: God the Giver, man the receiver"@en, "System der Gaben: Gott der Geber, der Mensch der Empfänger"@de ;
    skos:definition "Asking in belief brings receiving; power is always attributed to the Father within; supreme intelligence supplies all one desires or requires."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnPowerOfTheSpokenWord ;
