    rdfs:label "Blind-now-see statement yields wakefulness to one's good"@en, "Blind-jetzt-sehend-Satz bewirkt Wachheit für das Gute"@de ;
    skos:definition "The text holds that the practice \"Affirmation of the healed blind man\" brings about \"Hindrances friendly, obstacles springboards\"."@en ;
