    rdfs:label "Affirmation of invincible power and riding the waves"@en, "Affirmation: Gottes unbesiegbare Macht fegt alles hinweg; ich reite die Wellen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Declare that invincible divine power carries everything before it and that one rides the waves into one's Promised Land."@en ;
    skos:note "Affirmation, called very powerful."@en ;
