pmc:NewThoughtShinnDesireIsATremendousVibratoryForce a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Desire as seed and vibratory force to be rightly directed"@en, "Begehren als Same und Schwingungskraft, die recht zu lenken ist"@de ;
    skos:definition "After Prentice Mulford: persistent desire is a living seed that keeps growing; the law followed knowingly leads to happiness, blindly to misery; so desire must be steered."@en ;
    skos:note "Mulford quoted approvingly."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
