pmc:NewThoughtShinnDesireCommencedToBud a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Case: impatient wish to stay home fulfilled by losing the husband"@en, "Fall: ungeduldiger Wunsch, zu Hause zu bleiben, erfüllt durch Verlust des Mannes"@de ;
    skos:definition "A wife worn out by nightly outings impatiently wished to stay in and read; her husband left with another woman, taking his support, and she had her evenings."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a failure condition: the text names an outcome that goes wrong or does not come, and its cause. It names how pmp:NewThoughtShinnIOnlyDesireThatWhichInfiniteIntelligenceDesires fails."@en ;
