pmc:NewThoughtShinnProveGodByDirectingGodPowerYieldsTheDemonstrationComesToPass a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Directing and trusting God-power yields a demonstration"@en, "Lenken und Vertrauen bewirkt eine Demonstration"@de ;
    skos:definition "The text holds that the practice \"Proving God: direct divine power, then trust it\" brings about \"The demonstration comes to pass\"."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:NewThoughtShinnProveGodByDirectingGodPower ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:NewThoughtShinnTheDemonstrationComesToPass ;
