pmc:NewThoughtShinnAskedAmiss a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Unanswered desire means one asked amiss"@en, "Unerfüllter Wunsch bedeutet, man hat falsch gebeten"@de ;
    skos:definition "Not receiving the heart's desire is explained as wrong prayer; the answer comes in the same manner as the demand was sent; dreary and impatient desires are repeated as cause."@en ;
    skos:note "Repeats the dreary/impatient rule of ch. 3."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a failure condition: the text names an outcome that goes wrong or does not come, and its cause."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
