pmc:NewThoughtShinnCaretakerInABigHouse a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Resentful wish for a big house brings a caretaker's post"@en, "Grollender Wunsch nach großem Haus bringt eine Hausmeisterstelle"@de ;
    skos:definition "Wishing with resentment of lack for a grand house may land one as caretaker of such a house without sharing its opulence; idea from Carnegie's boarded mansion."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a failure condition: the text names an outcome that goes wrong or does not come, and its cause. It names how pmp:NewThoughtShinnAskWithPraiseAndThanksgiving fails."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnPowerOfTheSpokenWord ;
