    rdfs:label "To change your world, change your vibrations"@en, "Um die Welt zu ändern, die Schwingungen ändern"@de ;
    skos:definition "She cites Hermes Trismegistus on changing mood by changing vibrations and states she makes it stronger: the world changes with vibration; turning on a different current shows an immediate difference."@en ;
    skos:note "The author sharpens the saying she cites from Hermes Trismegistus instead of rejecting it."@en ;
