pmc:NewThoughtShinnLawOfLaws a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Law of laws: what you send out returns"@en, "Gesetz der Gesetze: was man aussendet, kehrt zurück"@de ;
    skos:definition "The golden rule is the supreme law, since every act and thought sent out comes back to the sender."@en ;
    skos:note "Differs from pmc:NewThoughtShinnLawOfKarma (The Game of Life, p. 39): there the returning law is named karma, life a game of boomerangs; here it is called the law of laws and stated as the golden rule."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnPowerOfTheSpokenWord ;
