    rdfs:label "Not criticizing saves one from criticism"@en, "Nicht-Kritisieren bewahrt vor Kritik"@de ;
    skos:definition "The text holds that the practice \"Refrain from criticizing others\" brings about \"Being spared criticism\"."@en ;
