pmc:NewThoughtShinnItAintGoingToRainNoMore a pm:Cautioning ;
    rdfs:label "Negative words prolong drought"@en, "Negative Worte verlängern die Dürre"@de ;
    skos:definition "A drought district asked people not to sing a song about rain never coming again, sensing negative words were connected with the drought."@en ;
    skos:note "From a newspaper report."@en ;
    pm:cautionsAbout pmc:NewThoughtShinnDominionOverTheElements ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:thirdPartyAscription ;
