pmc:NewThoughtShinnInnerRadianceIsInvinciblePowerPresupposesSeeGoodOnly a pm:Presupposing ;
    rdfs:label "Raised consciousness before the King of Glory enters"@en, "Erhobenes Bewusstsein, bevor der König der Herrlichkeit einzieht"@de ;
    skos:definition "Consciousness has first to be raised so that the King of Glory may enter."@en ;
