pmc:NewThoughtShinnFloodedWithAnInnerRadiance a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Feeling flooded with inner radiance"@en, "Gefühl, von innerem Glanz durchflutet zu sein"@de ;
    skos:definition "On reading the verse about the single eye one seems filled with an inner light."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a sign of success: the text names it as a mark that the work has taken effect. Counted apart from conditions of failure. It is announced for pmp:NewThoughtShinnSeeGoodOnly."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
