pmp:NewThoughtShinnSeeGoodOnly a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "The single eye: see good only"@en, "Das einfältige Auge: nur das Gute sehen"@de ;
    skos:definition "See only good and remain undisturbed by appearances of evil; judge not by appearances but rightly; perceive a single power, plan and planner."@en ;
    skos:note "Interpreted Matthew 6:22 and John 7:24."@en ;
    skos:note "Differs from pmc:NewThoughtShinnSingleEye (The Secret Door to Success, p. 200): there the single eye is a state in which one sees only Truth; here it is a practice, seeing good only and not being moved by appearances of evil."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
