    rdfs:label "Egoism and self-will lead to defeat"@en, "Selbstsucht und Eigenwille bringen Niederlage"@de ;
    skos:definition "Psalm 127:1 cited: building without the Lord is wasted labour."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a failure condition: the text names an outcome that goes wrong or does not come, and its cause."@en ;
