pmc:NewThoughtShinnTransmutesInjusticeIntoJustice a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Injustice transmuted into justice; enemies disarmed"@en, "Unrecht in Recht verwandelt; Feinde entwaffnet"@de ;
    skos:definition "With the single eye one turns injustice into justice and sees only victory, backed by countless hosts of power."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a capacity: a state the text holds attainable."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnPowerOfTheSpokenWord ;
