    rdfs:label "Good will and the single eye yield justice"@en, "Wohlwollen und einfältiges Auge bewirken Gerechtigkeit"@de ;
    skos:definition "The text holds that the practice \"Sending out good-will and blessings\" together with \"The single eye: see good only\" brings about \"Injustice transmuted into justice; enemies disarmed\"."@en ;
