pmc:NewThoughtShinnLifeDancesOn a pm:Cautioning ;
    rdfs:label "Do not try to dwell in or restore the past"@en, "Nicht versuchen, in der Vergangenheit zu leben oder sie zurückzuholen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Illustrated by the French film Life Dances On: a widow seeking her lost youth meets only disillusion; going back costs the things of today."@en ;
    pm:cautionsAbout pmc:NewThoughtShinnNowIsTheAppointedTime ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
