pmc:NewThoughtShinnBeUndisturbedYieldsAtOneMentWithTheDivineMind a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Indifference yields at-one-ment"@en, "Gleichmut bewirkt Einssein"@de ;
    skos:definition "The text holds that the practice \"Remaining undisturbed by a situation\" brings about \"At-one-ment with Divine Mind\"."@en ;
