pmc:NewThoughtShinnIfThineEyeBeEvil a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "An evil eye fills body and affairs with darkness"@en, "Ein böses Auge füllt Leib und Leben mit Finsternis"@de ;
    skos:definition "Imaging adverse conditions darkens the whole body; judging by appearances keeps one in an arena with lions of lack."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a failure condition: the text names an outcome that goes wrong or does not come, and its cause. It names how pmp:NewThoughtShinnSeeGoodOnly fails."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
