pmp:NewThoughtShinnBathedInTheLightOfTheChrist a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Daily picture yourself immersed in Christ light"@en, "Sich täglich im Licht des Christus gebadet sehen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Each day picture oneself immersed in Christ light, and learn to switch it on with the same confidence as an electric lamp; available whenever the eye is single."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
