pmc:NewThoughtShinnInnerRadianceIsInvinciblePower a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Inner radiance dissolves disease, lack, loss and adverse conditions"@en, "Innerer Glanz löst Krankheit, Mangel, Verlust und widrige Umstände auf"@de ;
    skos:definition "The inner light is invincible power, dissolving everything not divinely planned, including any weapon formed against one."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a capacity: a state the text holds attainable."@en ;
