pmc:NewThoughtShinnBathedInTheLightOfTheChristPresupposesSeeGoodOnly a pm:Presupposing ;
    rdfs:label "The Light is at command only when the eye is single"@en, "Das Licht steht nur bei einfältigem Auge zur Verfügung"@de ;
    skos:definition "Turning on the inner light is available only while one's eye is single, i.e. while one sees one power only."@en ;
