    rdfs:label "Leaving the plan to God yields perfect conditions"@en, "Den Plan Gott überlassen bewirkt vollkommene Umstände"@de ;
    skos:definition "The text holds that the practice \"Leaving the plan of one's life to the Divine Designer\" brings about \"All conditions permanently perfect (the divine plan)\"."@en ;
