pmc:NewThoughtShinnSpeakingTheWordForAnotherYieldsFaceOfABotticelli a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Spoken Word and book brought peace (case)"@en, "Gesprochenes Wort und Buch brachten Frieden (Fall)"@de ;
    skos:definition "Told as a case of a client, friend or acquaintance: the practice \"Speak the Word for another person\" was followed by the outcome \"grief-stricken woman transformed into a radiant one\"."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:NewThoughtShinnSpeakingTheWordForAnother ;
