pmc:NewThoughtShinnAnsweredAtTheAutomat a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Case: translator's question answered by a stranger at the Automat"@en, "Fall: Frage der Übersetzerin von einem Fremden im Automatenrestaurant beantwortet"@de ;
    skos:definition "A friend translating an Italian manuscript on a Persian ruler learned from a scholar at her table why publication was held back; the answer came when she had stopped worrying and was calm."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a capacity: a state the text holds attainable."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:thirdPartyAscription ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
