pmc:NewThoughtShinnInformationWillBeGivenPresupposesUndisturbedByASituation a pm:Presupposing ;
    rdfs:label "Calm unconcern before information arrives"@en, "Ruhige Gelassenheit, bevor die Auskunft kommt"@de ;
    skos:definition "While she worried nothing came; once peaceful and unconcerned the information arrived."@en ;
    pm:dependentStep pmc:NewThoughtShinnInformationWillBeGiven ;
