pmc:NewThoughtShinnJerusalemStandsForPeace a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Jerusalem means peace, feet mean understanding"@en, "Jerusalem bedeutet Frieden, die Fuße Verständnis"@de ;
    skos:definition "Understanding always brings one within the gates of peace."@en ;
    skos:note "Differs from pmc:NewThoughtShinnFeetAreUnderstanding (The Secret Door to Success, p. 183): there the feet as understanding stand for what cannot be taken away; here understanding is what brings one within the gates of peace, Jerusalem."@en ;
