pmp:NewThoughtShinnTakingAnAffirmation a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Take an affirmation to attain peace in turmoil"@en, "Eine Affirmation nehmen, um im Aufruhr Frieden zu finden"@de ;
    skos:definition "Since thought cannot be controlled but words can, use an affirmation; the word eventually prevails."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
