    rdfs:label "Words as dynamite; science and religion converging"@en, "Worte als Dynamit; Wissenschaft und Religion nähern sich"@de ;
    skos:definition "As science finds power in the atom, metaphysics finds it in thoughts and words; a spoken word produces a chemical change in the body."@en ;
