    rdfs:label "Lapsing from meetings and reading, swamped by negative talk"@en, "Abfall von Treffen und Lektüre, überflutet von negativem Gerede"@de ;
    skos:definition "The sick friend, a Truth student, had attended no meetings and done no reading for over a year; negative talk and thought had nearly felled her."@en ;
