    rdfs:label "Case: chronic bronchitis healed through the spoken word"@en, "Fall: chronische Bronchitis durch das gesprochene Wort geheilt"@de ;
    skos:definition "A friend bedridden for weeks near pneumonia telephoned for the word; with Shinn's spoken word and her own affirmation she improved at once, followed a hunch to go out despite warnings, and planned a luncheon the next day."@en ;
