    rdfs:label "Reverse a failure thought with a success thought"@en, "Einen Misserfolgsgedanken durch einen Erfolgsgedanken umkehren"@de ;
    skos:definition "Replace each failure thought by its opposite; where the failure thought is habitual, use a powerful affirmation, since words can be controlled even when thoughts cannot."@en ;
