    skos:note "Differs from pmc:NewThoughtShinnEternalVigilanceOverWords (The Secret Door to Success, p. 201): there vigilance is needed over all negative words and thoughts; here it is needed to dislodge a failure thought that has become a habit, with an affirmation as the means."@en ;
