pmc:NewThoughtShinnAwakenedManKnowsOnlyOnePower a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Race-man's illusion versus the awakened man's one power and one condition"@en, "Illusion des Gattungsmenschen gegen den Erwachten mit einer Macht und einem Zustand"@de ;
    skos:definition "Adam as generic race-man imagined loss, lack, sin, illness and death; those awakened know only God and good."@en ;
    skos:note "Differs from pmc:NewThoughtShinnAwakeFromTheAdamicDream (The Secret Door to Success, p. 230): there waking is helped by the law of agreement; here the awakened man is set against the race-man and knows one power and one condition only."@en ;
