pmc:NewThoughtShinnHashOverHardTimes a pm:Cautioning ;
    rdfs:label "Do not rehash hard times"@en, "Schwere Zeiten nicht wiederkäuen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Dwelling on past hardship draws one back into it; give thanks for the new day instead and stay immune to discouragement."@en ;
    pm:cautionsAbout pmp:NewThoughtShinnDawnOfANewDay ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnPowerOfTheSpokenWord ;
    dcterms:source "Florence Scovel Shinn, The Power of the Spoken Word (1945), in The Writings of Florence Scovel Shinn, eBook ed. (www.Self-Improvement-eBooks.com, 2007), Book Four, ch. 6 \"Your Big Opportunity\", p. 276; read in the archive.org text layers TheCompleteWorksOfFlorenceScovelShinn and the-writing-of-florence-scovel-shinn of this eBook; agreement with the 1945 print unchecked" .

pmp:NewThoughtShinnDawnOfANewDay a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Thanksgiving for each new dawn"@en, "Für den Anbruch eines neuen Tages danken"@de ;
    skos:definition "Instead of reviewing bad times, thank God for each new day as it begins."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnPowerOfTheSpokenWord ;
    dcterms:source "Florence Scovel Shinn, The Power of the Spoken Word (1945), in The Writings of Florence Scovel Shinn, eBook ed. (www.Self-Improvement-eBooks.com, 2007), Book Four, ch. 6 \"Your Big Opportunity\", p. 276; read in the archive.org text layers TheCompleteWorksOfFlorenceScovelShinn and the-writing-of-florence-scovel-shinn of this eBook; agreement with the 1945 print unchecked" .

pmc:NewThoughtShinnTheDemonstrationComesToPassPresupposesWhereasIWasBlindNowICanSee a pm:Presupposing ;
    rdfs:label "Wakefulness to one's good as condition of manifesting it"@en, "Hellwach für das eigene Gute, um es zu verwirklichen"@de ;
    skos:definition "The good is already on the path but manifests only for the awake."@en ;
    pm:dependentStep pmc:NewThoughtShinnTheDemonstrationComesToPass ;
    pm:priorStep pmp:NewThoughtShinnWhereasIWasBlindNowICanSee ;
    pm:prerequisiteStrength pm:prescribedOrder ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
