pmc:NewThoughtShinnFlashOfRealization a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Sudden flash of realization after statements of Truth"@en, "Plötzlicher Blitz der Erkenntnis nach Wahrheitssätzen"@de ;
    skos:definition "After making statements one suddenly feels oneself in new surroundings."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a sign of success: the text names it as a mark that the work has taken effect. Counted apart from conditions of failure. It is announced for pmp:NewThoughtShinnCallingOnTheLaw."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnPowerOfTheSpokenWord ;
