pmc:NewThoughtShinnOldNegativeConditionsFallingAway a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Feeling old negative conditions fall away"@en, "Gefühl, dass alte negative Zustände abfallen"@de ;
    skos:definition "After statements of Truth one is said to sense one's old negative circumstances dropping away; announced as what one will feel."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a sign of success: the text names it as a mark that the work has taken effect. Counted apart from conditions of failure. It is announced for pmp:NewThoughtShinnCallingOnTheLaw."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnPowerOfTheSpokenWord ;
