pmc:NewThoughtShinnPromisedLandOfPlenty a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Case: client saw a wall crumble and entered her land of plenty"@en, "Fall: Klientin sah eine Mauer zerfallen und betrat ihr Land der Fülle"@de ;
    skos:definition "She had a sudden image of stepping over a crumbling wall; soon after, prosperity came."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a capacity: a state the text holds attainable."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:thirdPartyAscription ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnPowerOfTheSpokenWord ;
