pmc:NewThoughtShinnWallsOfLackAndDelayYieldsPromisedLandOfPlenty a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Walls affirmation yielded plenty (case)"@en, "Mauer-Affirmation bewirkte Fülle (Fall)"@de ;
    skos:definition "Told as a case of a client, friend or acquaintance: the practice \"Walls-of-lack-and-delay affirmation\" was followed by the outcome \"client saw a wall crumble and entered her land of plenty\"."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:NewThoughtShinnWallsOfLackAndDelay ;
