pmc:NewThoughtShinnPicturingVividlyAnotherDisappointment a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Fearful picturing of disappointment repeated broken prospects"@en, "Ängstliches Ausmalen der Enttäuschung wiederholte geplatzte Aussichten"@de ;
    skos:definition "After an early broken engagement the daughter grew frantic whenever marriage loomed, vividly imagining another letdown, and suffered several."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a failure condition: the text names an outcome that goes wrong or does not come, and its cause."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:thirdPartyAscription ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnPowerOfTheSpokenWord ;
