pmc:NewThoughtShinnMrsNellie a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Case: Nellie married, the demon of fear dissolved"@en, "Fall: Nellie heiratete, der Dämon der Angst war aufgelöst"@de ;
    skos:definition "The daughter, who had feared every new prospect, is reported to have married after she and her mother kept to their affirmations; her fear is said to be gone for good."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a capacity: a state the text holds attainable."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:thirdPartyAscription ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnPowerOfTheSpokenWord ;
    dcterms:source "Florence Scovel Shinn, The Power of the Spoken Word (1945), in The Writings of Florence Scovel Shinn, eBook ed. (www.Self-Improvement-eBooks.com, 2007), Book Four, ch. 6 \"Your Big Opportunity\", p. 277; read in the archive.org text layers TheCompleteWorksOfFlorenceScovelShinn and the-writing-of-florence-scovel-shinn of this eBook; agreement with the 1945 print unchecked" .

pmc:NewThoughtShinnPullingDownOfStrongholds a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Negative thought-forms pulled down only by the God within"@en, "Negative Gedankenformen nur durch den inneren Gott niedergerissen"@de ;
    skos:definition "The human mind cannot cope with them; the superconscious wins the victory."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnPowerOfTheSpokenWord ;
    dcterms:source "Florence Scovel Shinn, The Power of the Spoken Word (1945), in The Writings of Florence Scovel Shinn, eBook ed. (www.Self-Improvement-eBooks.com, 2007), Book Four, ch. 6 \"Your Big Opportunity\", p. 277; read in the archive.org text layers TheCompleteWorksOfFlorenceScovelShinn and the-writing-of-florence-scovel-shinn of this eBook; agreement with the 1945 print unchecked" .

pmp:NewThoughtShinnThinkOnTheseThings a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Think and speak only on what is true, lovely and of good report"@en, "Nur über Wahres, Liebliches und Wohllautendes denken und sprechen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Following Philippians 4:8; she remarks that conversation would halt until people learned constructive talk."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnPowerOfTheSpokenWord ;
    dcterms:source "Florence Scovel Shinn, The Power of the Spoken Word (1945), in The Writings of Florence Scovel Shinn, eBook ed. (www.Self-Improvement-eBooks.com, 2007), Book Four, ch. 6 \"Your Big Opportunity\", p. 277; read in the archive.org text layers TheCompleteWorksOfFlorenceScovelShinn and the-writing-of-florence-scovel-shinn of this eBook; agreement with the 1945 print unchecked" .

#
# Chapter 7, In Nothing Be Anxious
#

pmc:NewThoughtShinnImmediateAndEndlessSupplyPresupposesWhenYePrayBelieveYeHaveIt a pm:Presupposing ;
    rdfs:label "The invisible supplying power works only if believed in"@en, "Die unsichtbare Versorgungskraft wirkt nur, wenn man an sie glaubt"@de ;
    skos:definition "Scripture bids one not to be anxious or to hoard, since an unseen power stands ready to meet every need; but this power is said to work only for one who believes in it."@en ;
    pm:dependentStep pmc:NewThoughtShinnImmediateAndEndlessSupply ;
    pm:priorStep pmp:NewThoughtShinnWhenYePrayBelieveYeHaveIt ;
    pm:prerequisiteStrength pm:statedNecessity ;
    pm:consequenceOfSkipping "It would not work." ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnPowerOfTheSpokenWord ;
    dcterms:source "Florence Scovel Shinn, The Power of the Spoken Word (1945), in The Writings of Florence Scovel Shinn, eBook ed. (www.Self-Improvement-eBooks.com, 2007), Book Four, ch. 7 \"In Nothing Be Anxious\", p. 279; read in the archive.org text layers TheCompleteWorksOfFlorenceScovelShinn and the-writing-of-florence-scovel-shinn of this eBook; agreement with the 1945 print unchecked" .

pmc:NewThoughtShinnBackOfEveryHappeningACause a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Behind every happening a cause we set going"@en, "Hinter jedem Geschehen eine Ursache, die wir selbst in Gang setzen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Trained in unbelief and the world of externals, people thought things just happened; in fact they started the machinery of good or evil themselves."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnPowerOfTheSpokenWord ;
    dcterms:source "Florence Scovel Shinn, The Power of the Spoken Word (1945), in The Writings of Florence Scovel Shinn, eBook ed. (www.Self-Improvement-eBooks.com, 2007), Book Four, ch. 7 \"In Nothing Be Anxious\", p. 279; read in the archive.org text layers TheCompleteWorksOfFlorenceScovelShinn and the-writing-of-florence-scovel-shinn of this eBook; agreement with the 1945 print unchecked" .

pmc:NewThoughtShinnHurledIntoTheEthers a pm:Cautioning ;
    rdfs:label "Words of anger, resentment or self-pity hurled into the ethers"@en, "In den Äther geschleuderte Worte von Zorn, Groll oder Selbstmitleid"@de ;
    skos:definition "Words and thoughts are dynamite to be handled with wisdom; careless negative words make life hard."@en ;
    pm:cautionsAbout pmc:NewThoughtShinnBackOfEveryHappeningACause ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnPowerOfTheSpokenWord ;
    dcterms:source "Florence Scovel Shinn, The Power of the Spoken Word (1945), in The Writings of Florence Scovel Shinn, eBook ed. (www.Self-Improvement-eBooks.com, 2007), Book Four, ch. 7 \"In Nothing Be Anxious\", p. 279; read in the archive.org text layers TheCompleteWorksOfFlorenceScovelShinn and the-writing-of-florence-scovel-shinn of this eBook; agreement with the 1945 print unchecked" .

pmp:NewThoughtShinnExperimentWithFaith a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Experiment with faith: be anxious for nothing, pray with thanksgiving"@en, "Mit dem Glauben experimentieren: um nichts besorgt sein, mit Dank beten"@de ;
    skos:definition "Trust the invisible God-power, let go of anxiety and make requests known to God in prayer and thanksgiving."@en ;
    skos:note "Framed as an experiment (Philippians 4:6)."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnPowerOfTheSpokenWord ;
    dcterms:source "Florence Scovel Shinn, The Power of the Spoken Word (1945), in The Writings of Florence Scovel Shinn, eBook ed. (www.Self-Improvement-eBooks.com, 2007), Book Four, ch. 7 \"In Nothing Be Anxious\", p. 279; read in the archive.org text layers TheCompleteWorksOfFlorenceScovelShinn and the-writing-of-florence-scovel-shinn of this eBook; agreement with the 1945 print unchecked" .

pmc:NewThoughtShinnMentalBarnacles a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Old thought-forms as barnacles scraped off in the dry-dock of a big situation"@en, "Alte Gedankenformen als Seepocken, im Trockendock einer großen Lage abgekratzt"@de ;
    skos:definition "Anxiety is habitual; a major crisis serves to remove clinging mental habits."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnPowerOfTheSpokenWord ;
    dcterms:source "Florence Scovel Shinn, The Power of the Spoken Word (1945), in The Writings of Florence Scovel Shinn, eBook ed. (www.Self-Improvement-eBooks.com, 2007), Book Four, ch. 7 \"In Nothing Be Anxious\", p. 279; read in the archive.org text layers TheCompleteWorksOfFlorenceScovelShinn and the-writing-of-florence-scovel-shinn of this eBook; agreement with the 1945 print unchecked" .

pmp:NewThoughtShinnFeelPoorDiscardThem a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Discard what makes you feel poor; tithe; follow leads in spending"@en, "Ablegen, was arm fühlen lässt; den Zehnten geben; beim Ausgeben Fingerzeigen folgen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Trust God, not externals, for supply; follow intuitive leads on spending; at once replace clothes that make one feel poor with something that makes one feel rich; give a tenth to good works even from little."@en ;
    skos:note "Steps taken from a client case."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnPowerOfTheSpokenWord ;
    dcterms:source "Florence Scovel Shinn, The Power of the Spoken Word (1945), in The Writings of Florence Scovel Shinn, eBook ed. (www.Self-Improvement-eBooks.com, 2007), Book Four, ch. 7 \"In Nothing Be Anxious\", p. 280; read in the archive.org text layers TheCompleteWorksOfFlorenceScovelShinn and the-writing-of-florence-scovel-shinn of this eBook; agreement with the 1945 print unchecked" .

pmc:NewThoughtShinnTappedHerInvisibleSupply a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Case: former money-coward received legacies and many thousands"@en, "Fall: frühere Geldängstliche erhielt Erbschaften und viele Tausende"@de ;
    skos:definition "An unrelated family friend left her a thousand dollars, another thousand followed months later, then a wide door opened for thousands more; she had lost all money anxiety and her supply never failed."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a capacity: a state the text holds attainable."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:thirdPartyAscription ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnPowerOfTheSpokenWord ;
    dcterms:source "Florence Scovel Shinn, The Power of the Spoken Word (1945), in The Writings of Florence Scovel Shinn, eBook ed. (www.Self-Improvement-eBooks.com, 2007), Book Four, ch. 7 \"In Nothing Be Anxious\", p. 280; read in the archive.org text layers TheCompleteWorksOfFlorenceScovelShinn and the-writing-of-florence-scovel-shinn of this eBook; agreement with the 1945 print unchecked" .

pmc:NewThoughtShinnFeelPoorDiscardThemYieldsTappedHerInvisibleSupply a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Faith steps in money yielded supply (case)"@en, "Glaubensschritte in Geldfragen bewirkten Versorgung (Fall)"@de ;
    skos:definition "She is said to have drawn on unseen supply held by the Universal as a bank."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:NewThoughtShinnFeelPoorDiscardThem ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:NewThoughtShinnTappedHerInvisibleSupply ;
