pmc:NewThoughtShinnNotVisualizing a pm:Cautioning ;
    rdfs:label "Against mere visualizing (making a mental picture)"@en, "Gegen bloßes Visualisieren (ein geistiges Bild machen)"@de ;
    skos:definition "Constructing a mental picture is a mental process that is apt to give mistaken or narrow results; self-warning against a common New Thought technique."@en ;
    skos:note "Differs from pmc:NewThoughtShinnVisualizingAndVisioning (The Game of Life, p. 91): there visualizing is set beside visioning in an ordering; here it is a warning that a mental picture may bring wrong and limited results, and a felt realization is required instead."@en ;
    pm:cautionsAbout pmp:NewThoughtShinnFeelingThatYouAreAlreadyThere ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnPowerOfTheSpokenWord ;
