pmc:NewThoughtShinnTrainingInAHammock a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Case: athlete trained the broad jump in a hammock"@en, "Fall: Athlet trainierte den Weitsprung in der Hängematte"@de ;
    skos:definition "A great all-round athlete practised by looking at a marked distance and seeing himself jump, eyes closed in his hammock."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a capacity: a state the text holds attainable."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:thirdPartyAscription ;
