    rdfs:label "Seeing oneself do it yielded athletic mastery (case)"@en, "Sich-tun-Sehen bewirkte sportliche Meisterschaft (Fall)"@de ;
    skos:definition "Told as a case of a client, friend or acquaintance: the practice \"Spiritual realization: feel you are already there\" was followed by the outcome \"athlete trained the broad jump in a hammock\"."@en ;
