pmc:NewThoughtShinnWithoutTheVision a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Without vision hard outer work accomplishes nothing"@en, "Ohne Vision bringt harte äußere Arbeit nichts"@de ;
    skos:definition "Lacking vision, people are said to perish in want."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a failure condition: the text names an outcome that goes wrong or does not come, and its cause. It names how pmp:NewThoughtShinnVisionMeansToSeeClearly fails."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
