pmp:NewThoughtShinnVisionMeansToSeeClearly a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Vision: clear sight of the destination, gaze fixed on the aim"@en, "Vision: klar sehen, wohin man geht, das Ziel im Auge behalten"@de ;
    skos:definition "Hold a clear sight of where one is going and keep one's eye on the goal, as all who did great things are said to have done."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnPowerOfTheSpokenWord ;
