pmc:NewThoughtShinnRumbleOfTheTrains a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Case: James J. Hill heard the trains before a rail was laid"@en, "Fall: James J. Hill hörte die Züge, bevor eine Schiene lag"@de ;
    skos:definition "His clear inner vision possessed him through obstacles; his wife believed in him. Henry Ford likewise credited a believing mother-in-law."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a capacity: a state the text holds attainable."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:thirdPartyAscription ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
