    rdfs:label "Clear vision yielded the railroad (case)"@en, "Klare Vision bewirkte die Eisenbahn (Fall)"@de ;
    skos:definition "Told as a case of a client, friend or acquaintance: the practice \"Vision: clear sight of the destination, gaze fixed on the aim\" was followed by the outcome \"James J. Hill heard the trains before a rail was laid\"."@en ;
