pmc:NewThoughtShinnTakesTwoToMakeADreamComeTrue a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "A dream needs two to come true"@en, "Es braucht zwei, um einen Traum wahr zu machen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Belief by another supports realization (when two agree it is done); believing in oneself makes others believe and establishes the vibration of assurance, so fear drops away."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnPowerOfTheSpokenWord ;
