pmc:NewThoughtShinnCommittingYourWaysUntoTheLordYieldsRightPlaceAtTheRightTime a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Obeying hunches yields right timing and place"@en, "Gehorsam gegenüber Eingebungen bewirkt rechten Ort und Zeitpunkt"@de ;
    skos:definition "The text holds that the practice \"Commit your ways to the Lord by following intuition\" brings about \"Always placed rightly and on time\"."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:NewThoughtShinnCommittingYourWaysUntoTheLord ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:NewThoughtShinnRightPlaceAtTheRightTime ;
