pmc:NewThoughtShinnRightPlaceAtTheRightTime a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Always placed rightly and on time"@en, "Immer am rechten Ort zur rechten Zeit"@de ;
    skos:definition "The intuitive person, moving under Divine guidance and never violating a hunch, is always rightly placed; intuition leads out of bondage and is invaluable in business."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a capacity: a state the text holds attainable."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnPowerOfTheSpokenWord ;
