pmc:NewThoughtShinnCourageToFollowIntuition a pm:Cautioning ;
    rdfs:label "Following intuition takes great courage"@en, "Der Intuition zu folgen erfordert großen Mut"@de ;
    skos:definition "Like a fearless Viking sailing unknown seas. Claude Bragdon is cited: living intuitively is living fourth-dimensionally."@en ;
    skos:note "Differs from pmc:NewThoughtShinnLiveFourthDimensionally (The Secret Door to Success, p. 183): there the Bragdon saying stands alone; here it follows a warning that it takes courage to follow intuition."@en ;
    pm:cautionsAbout pmp:NewThoughtShinnCommittingYourWaysUntoTheLord ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
