pmc:NewThoughtShinnNeglectedToAsk a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Missing blessings: not asked, or not asked aright"@en, "Fehlende Segnungen: nicht gebeten oder nicht recht gebeten"@de ;
    skos:definition "If blessings are missing, one has either failed to ask or asked in the wrong way."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a failure condition: the text names an outcome that goes wrong or does not come, and its cause."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnPowerOfTheSpokenWord ;
