pmc:NewThoughtShinnMachineOfAskingAndReceiving a pm:Systematizing ;
    rdfs:label "The asking-receiving machine and its lubricants"@en, "Die Maschine des Bittens und Empfangens und ihre Schmiermittel"@de ;
    skos:definition "Her model: asking and receiving is a machine kept running by active faith and expectancy; she lists four scriptural lubricants (believe you have it; be anxious for nothing; stand still and see salvation; do not set limits to God) and sums up that realization is manifestation."@en ;
    skos:note "Author's systematizing of earlier rules into one mechanism."@en ;
    pm:compiledBy "Florence Scovel Shinn, in the notes published in 1945, five years after her death" ;
    dcterms:date "1945"^^xsd:gYear ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:compilerInference ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnPowerOfTheSpokenWord ;
