pmc:NewThoughtShinnBullyGod a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Case: woman tried to bully God in prayer"@en, "Fall: Frau versuchte, Gott im Gebet herumzukommandieren"@de ;
    skos:definition "Some pray in anger and resentment; a correspondent reported telling God exactly what He ought to do, as she ordered people about."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a failure condition: the text names an outcome that goes wrong or does not come, and its cause. It names how pmp:NewThoughtShinnPrayWithPraiseAndThanksgiving fails."@en ;
