pmc:NewThoughtShinnLawOfDivineProtectionYieldsProtectsGuidesAndProvides a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Placing under divine protection yields protection"@en, "Unter göttlichen Schutz stellen bewirkt Schutz"@de ;
    skos:definition "The text holds that the practice \"Put whatever you love under divine protection\" brings about \"Divine protection, guidance and provision\"."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:NewThoughtShinnLawOfDivineProtection ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:NewThoughtShinnProtectsGuidesAndProvides ;
