pmc:NewThoughtShinnLeadsSeemTrivialAndSilly a pm:Cautioning ;
    rdfs:label "Leads often seem trivial or silly"@en, "Fingerzeige wirken oft belanglos oder albern"@de ;
    skos:definition "A purely intellectual person would dismiss them immediately; they should not be dismissed."@en ;
    pm:cautionsAbout pmp:NewThoughtShinnCommittingYourWaysUntoTheLord ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
