pmp:NewThoughtShinnAskForGuidanceSetReasoningAside a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Request guidance, set reasoning aside"@en, "Um Führung bitten und den Verstand beiseitelegen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Request guidance, put the reasoning mind aside; those not naturally intuitive make conscious contact by taking an affirmation."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
