    rdfs:label "Asking for guidance yields needed knowledge"@en, "Bitte um Führung bewirkt nötiges Wissen"@de ;
    skos:definition "The text holds that the practice \"Request guidance, set reasoning aside\" brings about \"Revelation of whatever one should know\"."@en ;
