pmc:NewThoughtShinnBusyWire a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Busy wire: discouragement, anger, resentment block intuition"@en, "Besetzte Leitung: Entmutigung, Zorn, Groll blockieren die Intuition"@de ;
    skos:definition "Negative emotions drown the voice of intuition, so God's message does not get through."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a failure condition: the text names an outcome that goes wrong or does not come, and its cause. It names how pmp:NewThoughtShinnAskForGuidanceSetReasoningAside fails."@en ;
