pmc:NewThoughtShinnStatementOfTruthWhenDiscouragedYieldsShallBeDelivered a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Statement in despair yields deliverance"@en, "Wahrheitssatz in Verzweiflung bewirkt Errettung"@de ;
    skos:definition "The text holds that the practice \"Make a statement of Truth when discouraged, angry or resentful\" brings about \"Deliverance; renewed strength\"."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:NewThoughtShinnStatementOfTruthWhenDiscouraged ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:NewThoughtShinnShallBeDelivered ;
