pmp:NewThoughtShinnStopPlanningPlottingAndScheming a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Stop planning, plotting and scheming"@en, "Aufhören zu planen, zu ranken und zu tüfteln"@de ;
    skos:definition "Leave the solution to Infinite Intelligence and its own methods; one's part is preparing for blessings and following intuitive leads."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
