pmp:NewThoughtShinnRightOfWay a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Closing affirmation granting Infinite Intelligence precedence"@en, "Schlussaffirmation: wir geben der Unendlichen Intelligenz jetzt Vorfahrt"@de ;
    skos:definition "A short statement that one now lets Infinite Intelligence go first, closing the seventh chapter."@en ;
    skos:note "Affirmation closing ch. 7."@en ;
