pmc:NewThoughtShinnAFriendlyAiredalePresupposesImmediatelyWalkUpToTheSituation a pm:Presupposing ;
    rdfs:label "Walk up at once, or the feared thing stays at your heels"@en, "Sofort darauf zugehen, sonst bleibt das Gefürchtete einem auf den Fersen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Lions such as lack, limitation, fear, injustice or dread appear almost daily and must be faced immediately."@en ;
    pm:dependentStep pmc:NewThoughtShinnAFriendlyAiredale ;
    pm:priorStep pmp:NewThoughtShinnWalkingUpToTheLion ;
    pm:prerequisiteStrength pm:statedNecessity ;
