    rdfs:label "Case: seven children grew up safe"@en, "Fall: sieben Kinder wuchsen unversehrt auf"@de ;
    skos:definition "A mother who knew her children divinely protected told an alarmed neighbour not to look at them climbing trees; all grew up sound."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a capacity: a state the text holds attainable."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:thirdPartyAscription ;
