    rdfs:label "Knowing divine protection kept the children safe (case)"@en, "Wissen um göttlichen Schutz bewahrte die Kinder (Fall)"@de ;
    skos:definition "Told as a case of a client, friend or acquaintance: the practice \"Put whatever you love under divine protection\" together with \"Turn your back on the danger and let God handle it\" was followed by the outcome \"seven children grew up safe\"."@en ;
