    rdfs:label "Resenters, resisters and regretters lose the game"@en, "Grollende, Widerstrebende und Bereuende verlieren das Spiel"@de ;
    skos:definition "Most people resent, resist or regret, exhaust their friends and lose every trick, because they do not live in the present."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a failure condition: the text names an outcome that goes wrong or does not come, and its cause."@en ;
