pmc:NewThoughtShinnUnafraidInTheNow a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Living fearless in the NOW releases supply"@en, "Furchtlos im JETZT leben setzt Versorgung frei"@de ;
    skos:definition "Heaven is being unafraid and using what one has, knowing the abundance of the spheres stands behind; supply is freed by fearless faith together with the spoken word; Egypt knew the power of the word."@en ;
    skos:note "Differs from pmp:NewThoughtShinnLiveFullyInTheNow (The Game of Life, p. 35): there living in the now is a practice of blessing past and future; here being unafraid in the now means using what one has without fear, which releases supply."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnPowerOfTheSpokenWord ;
