pmc:NewThoughtShinnMagicLives a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Renewed mind, body and affairs; a magic life once fear is gone"@en, "Erneuerter Geist, Leib und Lebensumstände; magisches Leben ohne Furcht"@de ;
    skos:definition "With fear wiped out, one's mind, body and affairs are said to be made new and one's life becomes magical."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a capacity: a state the text holds attainable."@en ;
