pmc:NewThoughtShinnSublimeAssurance a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Faith's sublime assurance opens a way to health, wealth, happiness"@en, "Die erhabene Gewissheit des Glaubens öffnet den Weg zu Gesundheit, Wohlstand, Glück"@de ;
    skos:definition "Christianity rests on faith; its assurance impresses the subconscious even amid adverse appearances; invisible supply waits to be freed through faith and spoken words."@en ;
    skos:note "Text has OCR 'Laith' for Faith."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
