pmc:NewThoughtShinnExactScience a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Jesus taught an exact science of mind"@en, "Jesus lehrte eine exakte Wissenschaft des Geistes"@de ;
    skos:definition "Statement on fixity of the method: the teaching is called an exact science, a mind science dealing with thought and the word, proven by His miracles."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
