pmc:NewThoughtShinnEatTheSpeckledApplesFirst a pm:Cautioning ;
    rdfs:label "Against the inherited pessimism of an age of doubt"@en, "Gegen den ererbten Pessimismus eines Zeitalters des Zweifels"@de ;
    skos:definition "People were raised to expect the worst and laugh at optimists; the advice to eat speckled apples first means never reaching the good ones before they spoil."@en ;
    pm:cautionsAbout pmp:NewThoughtShinnTransmuteFearIntoFaith ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
