pmc:NewThoughtShinnAnxietyAndWorryTwins a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Anxiety and worry destroy health, wealth and happiness"@en, "Angst und Sorge zerstören Gesundheit, Wohlstand und Glück"@de ;
    skos:definition "These twins have enslaved men."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a failure condition: the text names an outcome that goes wrong or does not come, and its cause."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
