pmc:NewThoughtShinnInvertedFaithPresupposesTransmuteFearIntoFaith a pm:Presupposing ;
    rdfs:label "Only one way to be rid of fear"@en, "Nur ein Weg, die Furcht loszuwerden"@de ;
    skos:definition "Transmutation into faith is declared the single means."@en ;
