pmc:NewThoughtShinnFatherWithinCanBeTrusted a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "The Father within can be wholly trusted when believed possible"@en, "Dem Vater im Innern kann man ganz vertrauen, wenn man es für möglich hält"@de ;
    skos:definition "Jesus demonstrated God-power repeatedly (loaves and fishes, raising the dead, coin from a fish) to convince followers, and promised greater works."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnPowerOfTheSpokenWord ;
