pmc:NewThoughtShinnTheDemonstrationComesToPassPresupposesWhenYePrayBelieveYeHaveIt a pm:Presupposing ;
    rdfs:label "Faith registers the idea, which then must objectify"@en, "Der Glaube prägt die Idee ein, die sich dann verwirklichen muss"@de ;
    skos:definition "Once an idea is registered in the subconscious it has to take outer form; hence faith is required."@en ;
    pm:dependentStep pmc:NewThoughtShinnTheDemonstrationComesToPass ;
    pm:priorStep pmp:NewThoughtShinnWhenYePrayBelieveYeHaveIt ;
