pmc:NewThoughtShinnTheHorseShow a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Case: penniless man got a position at the horse show"@en, "Fall: mittelloser Mann erhielt eine Stelle auf der Pferdeschau"@de ;
    skos:definition "With about five dollars left and refused everywhere, he followed a hunch to spend nearly all on a horse-show ticket; an old friend there gave him a fine job before the show ended."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a capacity: a state the text holds attainable."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:thirdPartyAscription ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnPowerOfTheSpokenWord ;
