pmc:NewThoughtShinnWalkingUpToTheLionYieldsTheHorseShow a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Hunch and fearless spending yielded the job (case)"@en, "Eingebung und furchtloses Ausgeben bewirkten die Stelle (Fall)"@de ;
    skos:definition "They are said to have set him in a fresh success vibration."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:NewThoughtShinnWalkingUpToTheLion, pmp:NewThoughtShinnCommittingYourWaysUntoTheLord ;
