pmp:NewThoughtShinnGiantSwingsIntoFaith a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Make giant swings into faith a habit"@en, "Riesenschwünge in den Glauben zur Gewohnheit machen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Make it a habit to leap boldly into faith, acting on a hunch even with one's last money."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
