    rdfs:label "Giant swings into faith yield marvellous returns"@en, "Riesenschwünge bewirken wunderbare Erträge"@de ;
    skos:definition "The text holds that the practice \"Make giant swings into faith a habit\" brings about \"Marvellous returns\"."@en ;
