pmc:NewThoughtShinnSucceedInAnyUndertakingPresupposesFeelingThatYouAreAlreadyThere a pm:Presupposing ;
    rdfs:label "Nothing is accomplished that one cannot see oneself accomplishing (repeated)"@en, "Nichts gelingt, was man sich nicht gelingen sieht (wiederholt)"@de ;
    skos:definition "Restated with the circus image from ch. 7."@en ;
