pmc:NewThoughtShinnLoseYourBalance a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Doubt and fear make you fall off into lack"@en, "Zweifel und Furcht lassen einen in den Mangel stürzen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Doubt and fear are said to upset one's balance, so that one drops into lack and limitation, like a performer off the wire."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a failure condition: the text names an outcome that goes wrong or does not come, and its cause. It names how pmp:NewThoughtShinnPoiseAndBalance fails."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
