pmp:NewThoughtShinnPoiseAndBalance a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Practise poise and balance like a wire walker; try again after each fall"@en, "Fassung und Gleichgewicht üben wie ein Seiltänzer; nach jedem Sturz neu versuchen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Trust in God is compared to slack-wire walking; it needs practice; however often one fails, try again until poise becomes habit; performers trained without music or applause."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnPowerOfTheSpokenWord ;
