pmc:NewThoughtShinnPoiseAndBalanceYieldsTheWorldIsYours a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Habit of balance yields the kingdom"@en, "Gewohnheit des Gleichgewichts bewirkt das Reich"@de ;
    skos:definition "The text holds that the practice \"Practise poise and balance like a wire walker; try again after each fall\" brings about \"The world is yours: joyful entry into the kingdom\"."@en ;
    pm:byPractice pmp:NewThoughtShinnPoiseAndBalance ;
    pm:yieldsCapacity pmc:NewThoughtShinnTheWorldIsYours ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
