pmc:NewThoughtShinnOutOfRhythmOutOfLuck a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Out of rhythm, out of luck"@en, "Aus dem Rhythmus, aus dem Glück"@de ;
    skos:definition "Success and happiness are said to hinge on rhythm, harmony and balance."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a failure condition: the text names an outcome that goes wrong or does not come, and its cause."@en ;
    skos:note "Differs from pmc:NewThoughtShinnRhythmHarmonyAndBalance (Your Word Is Your Wand, p. 16): there these are a state to be established; here losing them is named as a cause of bad luck."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:ScovelShinnPowerOfTheSpokenWord ;
