pmc:NewThoughtShinnDietOfTheRightWordsYieldsDissolveNegativeThoughtForms a pm:Yielding ;
    rdfs:label "Word diet yields dissolution of negative forms"@en, "Wortdiät löst negative Formen auf"@de ;
    skos:definition "The text holds that the practice \"A diet of right words: continual affirmation\" brings about \"Negative thought-forms dissolved; outer pictures changed\"."@en ;
