pmc:NewThoughtShinnIsItAsEasyAsThat a pm:Conceptualizing ;
    rdfs:label "Simplicity of the teaching"@en, "Einfachheit der Lehre"@de ;
    skos:definition "Hearers ask whether it can be so easy; many prefer difficulty; she holds this is why Jesus' simple teaching was forgotten, and says that in the twentieth century hidden things are revealed and primitive Christianity returns."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
