    rdfs:label "Affirmation: the Divine Plan is incorruptible and cannot be spoiled"@en, "Affirmation: der göttliche Plan ist unverderblich und nicht zu verderben"@de ;
    skos:definition "Given to a client haunted by the fear that even a fulfilled desire would be spoiled: the life plan is a perfect, indestructible idea in Divine Mind."@en ;
    skos:note "Affirmation."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
