    rdfs:label "Case: load lifted, first joy and freedom in years"@en, "Fall: Last genommen, erstmals seit Jahren Freude und Freiheit"@de ;
    skos:definition "A woman haunted for years by the fear that her good would be spoiled is reported to have felt the weight leave her and to have known joy and freedom for the first time in many years."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a capacity: a state the text holds attainable."@en ;
