    rdfs:label "A sense of freedom, followed by outer freedom"@en, "Ein Gefühl der Freiheit, dem die äußere Freiheit folgt"@de ;
    skos:definition "Knowing the Truth first gives an inner feeling of freedom; actual external freedom soon follows."@en ;
    skos:note "Counted as a sign of success: the text names it as a mark that the work has taken effect. Counted apart from conditions of failure. It is announced for pmp:NewThoughtShinnDivinePlanCannotBeSpoiled."@en ;
