pmc:NewThoughtShinnIdleCuriosity a pm:Cautioning ;
    rdfs:label "Dangerous to neglect one's own affairs for idle curiosity"@en, "Gefährlich, die eigenen Angelegenheiten aus müßiger Neugier zu vernachlässigen"@de ;
    skos:definition "Instead perfect oneself while taking a kindly interest in others."@en ;
    pm:cautionsAbout pmp:NewThoughtShinnTransmutingThemIntoHappySurprises ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
