pmp:NewThoughtShinnTransmutingThemIntoHappySurprises a pm:Practicing ;
    rdfs:label "Transmute disappointments into happy surprises"@en, "Enttäuschungen in frohe Überraschungen verwandeln"@de ;
    skos:definition "Turn disappointment into happy surprise, failure into success, unforgiveness into forgiveness, injustice into justice; perfecting one's own life leaves no time for others' affairs."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:withinTradition pmt:NewThought ;
